      "shape": "cylinder",
      "size": [
        0.7,
        0.2,
        0.7
      ],
      "color": "#3b3330",
      "lines": [
        "Ash, long cold. Someone cooked here for weeks, then stopped.",
        "A pot lies on its side. Whoever left it didn't plan on coming back down."
      ]
    },
    {
      "char": "B",
      "id": "bedrolls",
      "name": "Bedrolls",
      "kind": "examine",
      "shape": "box",
      "size": [
        0.8,
        0.15,
        0.5
      ],
      "color": "#6e5a44",
      "lines": [
        "Bedrolls along the wall. Most have gathered dust. One is still warm."
      ]
    },
    {
      "char": "T",
      "id": "tobin",
      "name": "Tobin",
      "kind": "npc",
      "shape": "npc",
      "color": "#6d8fb3",
      "call_out": {
        "radius": 3,
        "flag": "heard_tobin",
        "text": "Hey! You're climbing too?"
      },
      "dialogue": {
        "start": "hello",
        "start_if": [
          {
            "flag": "carrying_bird",
            "start": "again_bird"
          },
          {
            "flag": "tobin_done",
            "start": "again"
          }
        ],
        "nodes": {
          "hello": {
            "text": "Thirty-one days I've waited here. She says I'm not ready. Maybe nobody is.",
            "effects": {
              "set_flags": [
                "talked_tobin"
              ]
            },
            "choices": [
              {
                "text": "Who says you're not ready?",
                "next": "marta"
              },
              {
                "text": "Why are you climbing?",
                "next": "sister"
              },
              {
                "text": "Good luck.",
                "next": "brush_off",
                "effects": {
                  "nudge": {
                    "self": 0.5
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "marta": {
            "text": "Marta. The Gatekeeper. They say she used to wave everyone through. Then something came back down the stair, and now nobody goes up.",
            "effects": {
              "learn": [
                "marta_name",
                "something_came_down"
              ]
            },
            "next": "more"
          },
          "more": {
            "text": "Anything else?",
            "choices": [
              {
                "text": "Why are you climbing?",
                "next": "sister",
                "hide_if": "tobin_done"
              },
              {
                "text": "That's all.",
                "next": ""
              }
            ]
          },
          "sister": {
            "text": "My sister went up a year ago. Never sent word. I carved her this.",
            "next": "ask"
          },
          "ask": {
            "text": "He holds out a small wooden bird. \"If you get further than me... would you carry it up? Show it around?\"",
            "choices": [
              {
                "text": "I'll carry it.",
                "next": "took",
                "effects": {
                  "nudge": {
                    "others": 1
                  },
                  "set_flags": [
                    "carrying_bird",
                    "tobin_done"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "I travel light.",
                "next": "refused",
                "effects": {
                  "nudge": {
                    "self": 1
                  },
                  "set_flags": [
                    "refused_bird",
                    "tobin_done"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "took": {
            "text": "He presses it into your hand and doesn't let go right away. \"Her name's Wren.\"",
            "effects": {
              "learn": [
                "wren"
              ]
            }
          },
          "refused": {
            "text": "\"Right. Course.\" He tucks the bird back inside his coat."
          },
          "brush_off": {
            "text": "\"Yeah. You too.\" He goes back to counting the marks on the board."
          },
          "again_bird": {
            "text": "\"Her name's Wren. Don't forget.\""
          },
          "again": {
            "text": "\"Still here.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "char": "h",
      "id": "loose_board",
      "name": "Loose floorboard",
      "kind": "hidden",
      "shape": "plank",
      "color": "#8b6b47",
      "reveal_text": "A floorboard shifts under your weight.",
      "lines": [
        "You pry the board up. Underneath, wrapped in oilcloth, is a folded letter.",
        "\"Brother. I let the last one through, like all the others. You know what came back down. Forty houses on the lower stair.",
        "I won't open the stair again until I know who's climbing. If they ask, tell them I'm cruel. It's easier. — M.\""
      ],
      "effects": {
        "learn": [
          "marta_motive"
        ],
        "set_flags": [
          "found_letter"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "char": "E",
      "id": "passage",
      "name": "Passage to the Gate Court",
      "kind": "exit",
      "shape": "arch",
      "color": "#c2b49c",
      "dialogue": {
        "start": "ask",
        "nodes": {
          "ask": {
            "text": "The passage leads deeper into the gatehouse, toward the stair. Go on?",
            "choices": [
              {
                "text": "Go on.",
                "action": "end_level"
              },
              {
                "text": "Not yet.",
                "next": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    }
